<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Manettas half yr net profit A$1.5 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Manettas half yr net profit A$1.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     1.83 vs 0.01</p>
<p>    Net			     profit 1.50 vs loss 6.19</p>
<p>    Sales				   90.50 vs 87.06</p>
<p>    Other income			   5.96 vs 1.76</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		   profit 1.50 vs loss 13.30</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  gain 0.41 vs loss 6.43</p>
<p>    Tax			    expense 0.74 vs credit 0.18</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.01 vs 1.01</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   1.21 vs 0.91</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Manetta Ltd is a seafood supplier and is controlled by South Africa's Bidvest Group Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
